tion\n* Borivali Metro Station\n* Shimpoli Metro Station\n* Borivali Railway Station\n* Gokul Hotel Borivali (W) Bus Stop\n\n**Popular Landmarks in Borivali West**\n\n* Burger King\n* Borivali Biryani Centre ( Chikuwadi ) BBC\n* The Veg Treat II\n* Mexichino restaurant\n\n**Schools and Colleges in Borivali West**\n\n* St. Lawrence High School\n* Swami Vivekanand International School\n* Ryan International School, Kandivali East, Mumbai - CBSE\n* ORCHIDS The International School - Borivali\n* VEDANT INTERNATIONAL TODDLER TECH PRE SCHOOL\n* M.J. Junior College\n* Gokhale Educational Society's\n\n**Hospitals in Borivali West**\n\n* Apex Superspeciality Hospitals - Best Hospital in Borivali\n* Lotus Superspeciality Hospital\n* Sohum Eye Care Centre | Unit of Dr Agarwals Eye Hospital\n* Thunga Hospital\n* Phoenix Hospitals PVT.LTD.\n\n**Shopping and Entertainment in Borivali West**\n\n* Growel's 101 Mall\n* Raghuleela Mega Mall Kandivali West\n* Reliance Mall\n* ZUDIO – Utopia Garden Grove Mall, Borivali\n\n## About Bhoomi Shashwat Estate\n\n![Bhoomi Shashwat Estate](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/developer/o9QUSesZFEBV59ycQQsvx1cbLgEptqR2qDb7rvXg.jpg)\n\n* Year Estd. 1993\n* [Projects - 1](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/bhoomi-shashwat-estate-projects-in-mumbai)\n\n#### Bhoomi Shashwat Estate\n\nBhoomi Shashwat Estate\n\n## QR Codes of Bhoomi Pratishtha\n\n![P51800051136.webp](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/B8SCmimTCtU4yeCPrhUGrhTWTZ4lWVXBqaGynJIc.webp) P51800051136\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\n₹1,00,00,000 ₹2,00,00,000 ₹3,00,00,000\n\n###### Monthly EMI: ₹0.00\n\n## FAQ's of Bhoomi Pratishtha\n\nWhat is the address of Bhoomi Pratishtha?\n\nThe Bhoomi Pratishtha is located at Borivali West, Mumbai.  [Book Site Visit Here](#myModal)\n\nWhat is Rera Number of Bhoomi Pratishtha?\n\nBhoomi Pratishtha Borivali West RERA number is P51800051136.\n\nWhat configurations are available at Bhoomi Pratishtha Borivali West?