lic/img/calendar.svg) Possession Date\n\n![Possession Status](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/construction.svg) Possession Status\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) Project Rera No.\n\nDecember 2028\n\nUnder Construction\n\ncoming soon\n\n---\n\n### Key Highlights\n\n* Large-format 3 & 4 BHK residences with spacious layouts\n* Low-density luxury living within a sizeable land parcel\n* Covered parking for residents and visitors\n* Contemporary elevation with premium specifications\n* Ideal for luxury upgraders and end-use buyers\n\n---\n\n### Introduction\n\n### **Bhoomi AER – Borivali West, Mumbai**\n\nBhoomi AER by Bhoomi Group is a luxury residential development set in the prime locale of Borivali West, Mumbai. Crafted for discerning homebuyers, the project offers expansive 3 & 4 BHK residences with generous carpet areas, premium planning and a strong emphasis on privacy, comfort and elevated living. With limited large-format homes and a well-planned township-style layout, Bhoomi AER stands out as a high-end address in the Western Suburbs.\n\n### **Who Should Consider Bhoomi AER?**\n\n* Luxury homebuyers seeking spacious residences\n* Families upgrading to larger 3 & 4 BHK homes\n* Buyers prioritizing privacy, space & premium living\n* Investors targeting high-value assets in Western Suburbs\n\n[Read More](javascript:void(0);) [Read Less](javascript:void(0);)\n\n---\n\n### Download Brochure\n\nReceive a digital copy of   \nBhoomi AER brochure\n\n## Pricing of Bhoomi AER\n\n### Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n* [3 BHK Apartment](#tabs-7)\n* [4 BHK Apartment](#tabs-9)\n\n* [1200 sqft](#tabs-30397)\n\n![3 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n3 BHK | Carpet Area: 1200 sqft | Price:  ₹ 5.42 Cr\n\n* [1400 sqft](#tabs-30398)\n\n![4 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n4 BHK | Carpet Area: 1400 sqft | Price:  ₹ 6.32 C