 About Borivali West\n\nBorivali is a massive residential suburb often called the \"Gateway to the National Park.\" The West is known for its shopping hubs and the Gorai Creek, while the East provides direct access to nature. Highlights include the Sanjay Gandhi National Park, the Kanheri Caves, and the Pagoda in Gorai. It is a major railway terminus, ensuring that residents have easy access to the entire Western line.\n\n**Borivali West Location Offers Proximity To:**\n\n* Borivali (West) Metro Station\n* Eksar Metro Station\n* Borivali Metro Station\n* Shimpoli Metro Station\n* Borivali Railway Station\n* Gokul Hotel Borivali (W) Bus Stop\n\n**Popular Landmarks in Borivali West**\n\n* Burger King\n* Borivali Biryani Centre ( Chikuwadi ) BBC\n* The Veg Treat II\n* Mexichino restaurant\n\n**Schools and Colleges in Borivali West**\n\n* St. Lawrence High School\n* Swami Vivekanand International School\n* Ryan International School, Kandivali East, Mumbai - CBSE\n* ORCHIDS The International School - Borivali\n* VEDANT INTERNATIONAL TODDLER TECH PRE SCHOOL\n* M.J. Junior College\n* Gokhale Educational Society's\n\n**Hospitals in Borivali West**\n\n* Apex Superspeciality Hospitals - Best Hospital in Borivali\n* Lotus Superspeciality Hospital\n* Sohum Eye Care Centre | Unit of Dr Agarwals Eye Hospital\n* Thunga Hospital\n* Phoenix Hospitals PVT.LTD.\n\n**Shopping and Entertainment in Borivali West**\n\n* Growel's 101 Mall\n* Raghuleela Mega Mall Kandivali West\n* Reliance Mall\n* ZUDIO – Utopia Garden Grove Mall, Borivali\n\n## About Bhoomi Group\n\n![Bhoomi Group](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/developer/Xf2YDP3L3KwPpT9dq78MH20DHzl8AQv7cTYoGEaG.webp)\n\n* Year Estd. 1993\n* [Projects - 4](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/bhoomi-group-projects-in-mumbai)\n\n#### Bhoomi Group\n\nBhoomi Group\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\n₹1,00,00,000 ₹2,00,00,000 ₹3,00,00,000\n\n###### Monthly EMI: ₹0.00\n\n## FAQ's of Bhoomi AER\n\nWhat is the address of Bhoomi AER?\n\nThe Bhoomi AER is located at Boriwali West Mumbai.  [Book Site Visit Here](#myModal)\n\nWhat is Rera Number of Bhoomi AER?\n\nBhoomi AER Borivali West RERA number is coming soon.\n\nWhat configurations are available at Bhoomi AER Borivali West?\n\nBhoomi AER offers premium 3,4 BHK Apartment flats for sale in Borivali West.\n\nWhat is the starting price of a flat at Bhoomi AER Borivali West?\n\nBhoomi AER flat price in Borivali West starts at ₹ 5.42 Cr Onwards.\n\n...\n\nHow many floors are there in the Bhoomi AER Borivali West project?\n\nThe Bhoomi AER Borivali West project boasts G+5P+33 storeys offering well-planned layouts and modern amenities.\n\nWhat is the Possession Date of Bhoomi AER Borivali West?\n\nThe project is Under Construction   \n The Bhoomi AER Borivali West RERA possession is scheduled for December 2028.\n\nWhy choose the Bhoomi AER residential project in Borivali West?\n\nBhoomi AER is one of the best  [residential projects in Borivali West](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/residential-property-for-sale-in-borivali-west-mumbai) for both investment and living purposes. Get access to the best of schools, hospitals, and entertainment hubs.  [Express your interest today](#myModal)\n\nFrom where to get the floor plan of Bhoomi AER Borivali West?\n\nThe Bhoomi AER Borivali West floor plan is designed for optimum use and plenty of natural light. The layouts are designed as per Vastu principles.  [Check out the floor plan here.](#myModal)\n\nFrom where to get the price sheet of Bhoomi AER Borivali West?\n\nThe Bhoomi AER Borivali West price sheet is important for clarity on the price breakdown and other payment details of the flat.  [Check price sheet](#myModal)\n\nWhat are the stamp duty and registration charges in Borivali West’s Bhoomi AER project?\n\nThe stamp duty and registration charges in Borivali West for Bhoomi AER may vary depending on current government regulations. For the latest update connect with our sales team. [Call Now](tel:7045670457)\n\nWhat kind of amenities are available at Bhoomi AER Borivali West?\n\nThe Bhoomi AER project in Borivali West offers a wide range of lifestyle amenities, including a swimming pool, jogging track, gym, kids play area, multipurpose lawn, garden, senior citizen zone, and more.\n\nHow is the connectivity near Bhoomi AER Borivali West?\n\nStrategically located on in Borivali West, Bhoomi AER enjoys exceptional connectivity via roads, highways, and railways. The upcoming infrastructure makes it easier for daily travelers.\n\n## More Projects near Borivali West\n\n[![Kanakia Privaasa Borivali](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/4RphzHWuhW2a2f3IB9hok73cae5rUk2kHCfvYRL6.webp)\n\nRead more](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/kanakia-privaasa-borivali-project-borivali-west-mumbai/8884) \n\n### [Kanakia Privaasa Borivali](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/kanakia-privaasa-borivali-project-borivali-west-mumbai/8884)\n\n##### by Kanakia Spaces Realty\n\n2,3 BHK Apartment  \n Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n[![Konark Zen Pristine](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/Mny9qMnM2iMeQhoZlo6N3w56YTXJvqsGCSA0gI9q.webp)\n\nRead more](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/konark-zen-pristine-project-borivali-west-mumbai/8881) \n\n### [Konark Zen Pristine](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/konark-zen-pristine-project-borivali-west-mumbai/8881)\n\n##### by Konark Shakti Group\n\n2,3 BHK Apartment  \n Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n₹ 2.46 Cr - 4.01 Cr\n\n[![The lush Life code name](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/csp.webp)\n\nRead more](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/the-lush-life-code-name-project-borivali-west-mumbai/8855) \n\n### [The lush Life code name](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/the-lush-life-code-name-project-borivali-west-mumbai/8855)\n\n##### by Konark Shakti Group\n\n2,3 BHK Apartment  \n Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n[![Ocean